---
Create DSP unit tests for effects (filter, delay, reverb).

Verify effects produce correct output and handle edge cases.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Test biquad filter: impulse response matches expected coefficients
- [ ] Test delay: output delayed by correct number of samples
- [ ] Test delay: BPM sync calculates correct delay time
- [ ] Test reverb: output is non-zero for impulse input
- [ ] Test reverb: output decays to near-zero after sufficient time
- [ ] Test effects chain: multiple effects in series produce expected output
- [ ] All effects handle zero-length buffers without crash

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build and run effects_test target
- [ ] Filter: process impulse, verify frequency response shape
- [ ] Delay: process impulse, verify delayed copy at correct offset
- [ ] Reverb: process impulse, verify decay envelope
- [ ] Chain: filter+delay+reverb, verify non-zero output
